'''Necromancer [[Istani armor]]''' is an art type available in the Nightfall campaign as starter armor (named '''Initiate's'''), as collector armor for the region of [[Istan]], and as regular crafted armor. The collector headgear is only available with a [[Soul Reaping]] +1 bonus. 

There is no [[Prestige armor|prestige]] version of Istani armor. However, [[Necromancer Primeval armor|Primeval armor]] has resemblances to it.

